              "body": "<h1>Q4 studio goals</h1><p>Grow retainer revenue and keep utilization healthy without weekend work.</p><h2>Targets</h2><ul><li><p>2 active client retainers</p></li><li><p>1 published case study per month</p></li><li><p>Invoices sent within 48h of milestone</p></li></ul><p><strong>Owner:</strong> Gábor</p>",
