            {
              "slug": "pricing-notes",
              "title": "Pricing notes",
              "body": "<h1>Pricing notes</h1><p>Day rate and package options for discovery, design systems, and build sprints.</p><ul><li><p>Discovery workshop: fixed</p></li><li><p>Retainer: 2 days / week</p></li><li><p>Rush fee: +25%</p></li></ul>",
